Last day all together!

Luke, Priya & Anant stayed for the program and then went back to the DEVI School.

Had lobster for the first time in my life! (mid)

Explored the amazing red shores of PEI - simply stunning!

Turns out Anant had my pillow cover from DEVI School (I graduated 5 years ago - hahahaha)

Drive Update: 1092km

Self-Realizations so far: 49

